        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSBU, Solid Brass Button Tip Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Brass Hinge Button Tip Finial is an easy way to add a little something extra to your hinges for a finished look. Choose the finish that matches your Deltana Brass Hinges and simply screw it on the the ends of the hinge--but remember to order 2 per hinge (one for the top and one for the bottom). The Button Tip Finial for Deltana Brass Hinges has a classic look that will meld with any decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge. For use with <b>Brass Door Hinges</b> (except <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"> 6\" x 6\" Brass Hinge</a>).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Brass Hinge Button Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tip Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Tip Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>8mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
