                "title": "Button Tip Finial For Deltana Brass Hinges, Deltana DSBU",
                "description": "Deltana DSBU, Button Tip Finial For Deltana Brass Hinges - The Brass Hinge Button Tip Finial is an easy way to add a little something extra to your hinges for a finished look. Choose the finish that matches your Deltana Brass Hinges and simply screw it on the the ends of the hinge--but remember to order 2 per hinge (one for the top and one for the bottom). The Button Tip Finial for Deltana Brass Hinges has a classic look that will meld with any decor.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Button Tip Finial For Deltana Brass Hinges, Deltana DSBU, DEL-DSBU deltana Button finials, solid brass finials, brass hinge tips, deltana Button tips, deltana DSBU Button finials, Button Tip Hinge Finials, solid brass hinge finials, Brass Hinge Button Tip Finials, DEL-DSBU10B, DEL-DSBU14, DEL-DSBU14\r\n5, DEL-DSBU15A, DEL-DSBU19, DEL-DSBU26, DEL-DSBU26D, DEL-DSBU3, DEL-DSBU3UNL, DEL-DSBU5, DEL-DSBUCR003,"
